// ▌▝ ▌▙▌▙▌▙▌▐▖▙▖▄▌  ▙▌▌ █▌▙▌▐▖▙▌
//                         ▌     
{
  "reload_style_on_change": true,
  "toggle": true,
  "layer": "top",
  "position": "left",
  "margin-top": 0,
  "margin-bottom": 0,
  "margin-left": 0,
  "margin-right": 0,
  "spacing": 0,
  "include": ["~/.config/waybar/modules.json"],
  "modules-left": ["custom/rofi", "clock#hora", "custom/separator", "clock#fecha","custom/cachy", "cpu", "custom/weather"],
  "modules-center": ["custom/cava-mini", "mpris", "niri/workspaces", "privacy"],
  "modules-right": [
    "group/extras",
    "network",
    "bluetooth",
    "pulseaudio#microphone",
    "group/audio",
    // "group/brightness",
    "custom/ddc-brightness",
    "custom/powerprofile",
    "battery",
    "custom/powermenu"
  ]
}
